<title>ISRAEL: SOCCER-ISRAEL LEAD CYPRUS 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL LEAD CYPRUS 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel led Cyprus 2-0 in their World Cup group five qualifying match on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Eli Ohana, 3, 72</p>
